# Presentation-golden corpus manifest for Spyro 3 (fields as in
# scripts/presentation-corpus.manifest: name|start|interval|freeze|pins).
# The level loads by VBL ~841 under --skip-to-level and gameplay is live by
# ~1200; 1500 leaves the fade settled.
# The pin holds VBL 1500 on the sub-tick leg as well as the canonical one: the
# grid's intermediate samples land at +interval/2, so the pose the player walk
# was measured against had no __inter__ tile of its own.
# 2700 pins the level transition past the grid's last sample: the movie's
# inputs end at 2589 and the run continues, so the sub-tick leg there is
# the transition gamestate, where the re-extract draws the cyclorama and the
# player and every other producer returns empty. The grid's own 2650
# intermediate sample covers the transition's start; 2700 covers it 50 VBLs
# further in, where the canonical frame no longer moves between ticks.
sunrise-spring-sunny-villa-portal-entry|1500|100||1500,2700

# sunrise-spring-surface-swim arms the player draw's water-plane split.
# g_Spyro+0x28 is zero on every frame of the other three bk2s and of the whole
# 20k attract demo (six levels); it is non-zero from VBL 1889 to this movie's
# end, with animationState 0x2B (SWIM_MOVE_SURFACE) and movementState 0x0A
# (SWIM_SURFACE), so the split's classification, its depth cue and its cut have
# no other row in the corpus.
sunrise-spring-surface-swim|1900|150||1900,2000,2200

# icy-peak-reflective-mirror arms the player draw's mirrored copy.
# g_Spyro+0x2C is the avatar's height above a material-class-4 surface; of the
# 37 levels only Icy Peak, Midday Gardens, Frozen Altars and Bugbot Factory
# carry a class-4 material at all, and the word is zero on every frame of the
# other four bk2s and of the whole 20k attract demo. Icy Peak spawns beside
# such a surface: idle to VBL 1300, then Up + Circle (charge) with a 60-frame
# Right every 400 to hold the rink, and the word is non-zero from VBL 1858 to
# this movie's end, so the reflection's matrix negation, its inverted
# back-face test and its ordering bias have no other row in the corpus. The
# pins are the frames where the copy is least occluded by the surface above
# it: 5011 to 7167 pixels of the frame move when the reflection is suppressed,
# against 588 to 1421 on the grid samples after 2025.
icy-peak-reflective-mirror|1900|150||1900,1950,2000

# sunrise-spring-camera-swing holds R2 from VBL 1500 so the camera orbits the
# player while two animated-kind mobys and the simple-kind gems, baskets and
# chest stay in view. The pins hold sub-tick presents mid-swing, where an
# animated record replayed in the tick camera's view space is displaced from
# the interpolated camera by half a tick of rotation.
sunrise-spring-camera-swing|1500|100||1520,1540,1560
